  _senarioDescription: With shaky hands you slowly crack open the door to the study
    open, and immediately you notice the window is wide open, papers are everywhere,
    and your shelves have been knocked over. As you approach the window to close
    it, you see a footprint on the windowsill directing you out to the roof. Should
    you follow the print or back up and check out your bedroom?
